# Feature description: Ratio of SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MAJOR_AXIS to SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS.
# Usefulness: This feature captures asymmetrical variance between the major and minor axes of the silhouette. Larger vehicles like BUS or VAN might exhibit higher asymmetry compared to compact cars. This feature is useful for separating vehicles with distinct structural differences.
df['VARIANCE_ASYMMETRY_RATIO'] = df['SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MAJOR_AXIS'] / (df['SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS'] + 1e-5)
