h the aspect ratio of the primary axes. The original column is now redundant.\ndf.drop(columns=['RADIUS_RATIO'], inplace=True)\n```end\n\n---\n\n### Final Notes ###\n1. These features improve separability by emphasizing geometric relationships between existing attributes, such as compactness, skewness, and radius variance.  \n2. Dropping redundant columns ensures clarity and avoids overlap in the transformed feature space.  \n3. The feature additions and deletions are intuitive and align with the task's goal of classifying vehicle silhouettes based on extracted shape characteristics."]
